<title>USA: Great Lakes sets accord with pilots union.</title>
<headline>Great Lakes sets accord with pilots union.</headline>
<dateline>SPENCER, Iowa 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Great Lakes Aviation Ltd and the union representing the airline's pilots on Monday they had reached a tentative new agreement.</p>
<p>Details of the agreement with workers represented by the International Brotherhood of Teamsters-Airline Division, were not released.</p>
<p>The argeement is subject to ratification by the pilots.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
